%% SM-03 Guidance Appointment state machine
%% Transition table: GuidanceAppointmentWorkflowService::TRANSITIONS (verbatim)
%% Values in [brackets] are the permitted actor for that transition.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> requested : student books slot (bookAppointment)

    requested --> confirmed : [counselor] confirm
    requested --> rejected : [counselor] reject (reason required)
    requested --> cancelled : [student] cancel

    confirmed --> completed : [counselor] mark completed
    confirmed --> cancelled : [student] cancel (outside notice window)

    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]

    note right of requested
        Blocking statuses = requested, confirmed.
        Only these two occupy a time slot and
        are checked for counselor/student conflict.
    end note

    note right of confirmed
        Reminder: guidance:send-reminders stamps
        reminder_sent_at before notifying, so an
        appointment is reminded exactly once.
    end note
